hree models' predicted probabilities (DeBERTa, XGBoost, LR) and the target is the true labels. The optimal weights are derived from the logistic regression coefficients via softmax. Also implement cosine annealing with warm restarts (CosineAnnealingWarmRestarts, T_0=2, T_mult=2, initial LR=3e-5, min LR=1e-6) and gradient accumulation with 4 steps as per the initial plan. The number of epochs remains 40 with early stopping patience of 5."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
